      "title": "Clean and Renewable Energy",
      "content": "Fossil fuels like coal and oil cause severe air pollution and global warming. To protect the planet, renewable energy sources such as solar power, wind, and hydropower must be developed. Solar panels absorb sunlight and convert it into clean electricity without harmful emissions."
